creatures:
- name: Kraken
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 18  
      **Hit Points** 481 (rollable(dice=26d20 + 208,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Swim 120 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+14,label=+14,dicelabel=Initiative) (24)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=30)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+17,label=+17,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=22)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=18)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+11,label=+11,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=26)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+15,label=+15,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** History rollable(dice=1d20+13,label=+13,dicelabel=History Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+11,label=+11,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** cold, lightning  
      **Condition Immunities** frightened, grappled, paralyzed, restrained  
      **Senses** truesight 120 ft., Passive Perception 21  
      **Languages** understands Abyssal, Celestial, Infernal, and Primordial but can't speak; telepathy 120 ft.  
      **Challenge** 23 (50,000 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +7  

      ## Traits

      ***Amphibious.*** The kraken can breathe air and water.

      ***Legendary Resistance (4/Day, or 5/Day in Lair).*** If the kraken fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.

      ***Siege Monster.*** The kraken deals double damage to objects and structures.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The kraken makes two Tentacle attacks and uses Fling, Lightning Strike, or Swallow.

      ***Tentacle.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+17,label=+17,dicelabel=To Hit [Tentacle]), reach 30 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=4d6+10,dicelabel=Damage [Tentacle]) Bludgeoning damage. The target has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 20) from one of ten tentacles, and it has the ***Restrained*** condition until the grapple ends.

      ***Fling.*** The kraken throws a Large or smaller creature ***Grappled*** by it to a space it can see within 60 feet of itself that isn't in the air. *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 25, the creature thrown and each creature in the destination space. *Failure:* rollable(dice=4d8,dicelabel=Damage [Fling]) Bludgeoning damage, and the target has the ***Prone*** condition. *Success:* Half damage only.

      ***Lightning Strike.*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 23, one creature the kraken can see within 120 feet. *Failure:* rollable(dice=6d10,dicelabel=Damage [Lightning Strike]) Lightning damage. *Success:* Half damage.

      ***Swallow.*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 25, one creature ***Grappled*** by the kraken (it can have up to four creatures swallowed at a time). *Failure:* rollable(dice=3d8+10,dicelabel=Damage [Swallow]) Piercing damage. If the target is Large or smaller, it is swallowed and no longer ***Grappled***. A swallowed creature has the ***Restrained*** condition, has ***Total Cover*** against attacks and other effects outside the kraken, and takes rollable(dice=7d6,dicelabel=Damage [Swallow]) Acid damage at the start of each of its turns.

      If the kraken takes 50 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, the kraken must succeed on a DC 25 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, each of which falls in a space within 10 feet of the kraken with the ***Prone*** condition. If the kraken dies, any swallowed creature no longer has the ***Restrained*** condition and can escape from the corpse using 15 feet of movement, exiting ***Prone***.

      ## Legendary Actions

      *Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature's turn, The Kraken can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The Kraken regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.*

      ***Storm Bolt.*** The kraken uses Lightning Strike.

      ***Toxic Ink.*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 23, each creature in a 15-foot ***Emanation*** originating from the kraken while it is underwater. *Failure:* The target has the ***Blinded*** and ***Poisoned*** conditions until the end of the kraken's next turn. The kraken then moves up to its ***Speed***. *Failure or Success:* The kraken can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Gargantuan Monstrosity (Titan), Chaotic Evil*  
    **Challenge** 23
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024kraken
  status: 1

